  products: ["Your catalog starts with one part", "Add the brand, manufacturer number and product details. You can connect packaging, stock and vehicle fitment as you go."],
  skus: ["Give each selling unit a SKU", "Link a product to the unit or package you sell. Stock and prices will follow this SKU."],
